<%- include('partials/nav') %>
  <main class="container layer">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      I'm <%= name %>, a Computer Science student at the University of Houston (minoring in
      Cybersecurity) with a background in leading small dev teams. I led the team behind
      <a href="/projects/esoterra">Esoterra</a>, a two-semester Unreal Engine project that placed
      1st both semesters, and the team behind <a href="/projects/the-odyssey">The Odyssey</a>, a
      VR co-op escape room shipped to a web store, whose members had no prior game development
      experience going in. I like building things end-to-end: gameplay systems, backend services,
      and the databases underneath them.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <ul class="contact-list">
      <li><a href="mailto:<%= contact.email %>"><%= contact.email %></a></li>
      <li><%= contact.phone %></li>
      <li><a href="<%= contact.linkedin.url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><%= contact.linkedin.label %></a></li>
      <li><a href="<%= contact.github.url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><%= contact.github.label %></a></li>
    </ul>
  </main>
